<title>POLAND: Jelfa plans no 1996 dividend.</title>
<headline>Jelfa plans no 1996 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish pharmaceuticals firm Jelfa SA plans no 1996 payout and wants to earmark all last year's net profit of 20.1 million zlotys for reserve capital, social fund and covering earlier losses, the firm said in a statement.</p>
<p>Jelfa said it wanted to earmark 19.6 million zlotys for reserve capital, 0.5 million for social fund and 7,300 zlotys for covering former losses, but said a final decision would be taken at its general shareholders meeting on May 23.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
